<title>USA: Pepsi Puerto Rico named in lawsuit.</title>
<headline>Pepsi Puerto Rico named in lawsuit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lawyers for plaintiffs said on Tuesday that a class action lawsuit has been filed in the U.S. District Court for the District of Puerto Rico on behalf of all purchasers of Class B common stock of Pepsi-Cola Puerto Rico Bottling Co.</p>
<p>The attorneys said the complaint alleges Pepsi Bottling violated the federal securities laws by misrepresenting and/or omitting material information concerning Pepsi Bottling's financial condition and results of operations.</p>
</text>
